{
  "recommendation": "The strongest documented sign-up offer currently available is the EcoCard: earn 2,000 sustainability points after spending $5,000 in eligible purchases during your first month. Those points redeem at $0.01 each, for approximately $20 in value.",
  "important_terms": {
    "annual_fee": "$50",
    "purchase_apr": "19.99% on carried balances",
    "minimum_credit_score": "No stated credit-score requirement",
    "offer_window": "2025-08-01 through 2025-12-15",
    "qualifying_spend": "At least $5,000 in eligible purchases within one month of account opening"
  },
  "comparison": "A Silver Rewards Card offer of a $500 statement credit after $2,000 in first-month spending was documented, but its application window ended on 2025-06-30, so it is not currently available.",
  "bottom_line": "If you can comfortably meet the $5,000 spending requirement without carrying a balance, the EcoCard is the best current documented sign-up offer. However, its bonus is modest relative to the spending requirement, and the annual fee reduces the first-year net value to about negative $30 before considering ongoing rewards.",
  "next_step": "If you tell me your expected first-month spending, whether you prefer cash back or travel-style points, and your approximate credit profile, I can help determine whether the EcoCard is a good fit."
}
